# Original Gateway opening, PV messages, receptionist exchange, and T20 class.
# Checked checkpoints can be validated in one replay with --check-labels.
COMMAND take debit card
COMMAND put debit card in pv slot
MENU_KEYS 1,N,N,0,0
ASSERT_LOCATION 126 d3
LABEL pv_messages_read
COMMAND open drawer
COMMAND take book
COMMAND read book
COMMAND east
COMMAND northwest
COMMAND give book to receptionist
ASSERT_LOCATION d3 ec
ASSERT_LOCATION 123 0
ASSERT_LOCATION 130 d3
LABEL office_book_exchange
COMMAND southeast
COMMAND north
COMMAND down
COMMAND west
ASSERT_LOCATION d3 f7
LABEL room_t20
COMMAND wait until 15:00
COMMAND wait
COMMAND wait
COMMAND wait
COMMAND wait
ASSERT_LOCATION d3 f7
ASSERT_LOCATION 132 d3
LABEL class_badge_awarded
